[* 
files.rdn
Copyright (c) 2023-2026 Ray Den
SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT

Purpose:
Cross-platform wrapper over the native file IO module.

Loading behavior:
This module chooses the shared-library suffix from __sharedlib_ext and loads:
../nativelibs/files(.so|.dylib|.dll)

Exports:
- readLines   : native function, path -> list of lines
- writeLines  : native function, path list -> true
- appendLines : native function, path list -> true
- slurp       : wrapper, path -> full text string
- spit        : wrapper, path text -> true
- appendFileText : wrapper, path text -> true

Examples:
"./libs/files.rdn" load
"/tmp/demo.txt" ("alpha" "beta") writeLines call pop
"/tmp/demo.txt" readLines call print
"\n" print
"/tmp/demo.txt" "gamma" spit call pop
"/tmp/demo.txt" slurp call print
*]

"../nativelibs/files" __sharedlib_ext to_string swap pop append loadnative

slurp defun
    readText call
end

spit defun
    writeText call
end

appendFileText defun
    appendText call
end
